OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1786411079
OL,3,CSales of cool clothes and garden
OL,4,Caccessories soar as heat dominates
OL,5,Cspending
OL,7,FConsumer demand for cool clothes and
OL,8,Fgarden accessories was a bright spot
OL,9,Fin an otherwise glum July for
OL,10,Fretailers as the relentless heat took
OL,11,Fits toll, figures show.
OL,13,FTotal retail sales across the UK were
OL,14,Fup 1.3% year on year last month, below
OL,15,Fthe 12-month average of 1.8%,
OL,16,Faccording to data from the British
OL,17,FRetail Consortium (BRC) and KPMG.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/8
