OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1786411079
OL,3,CSales of cool clothes and garden
OL,4,Caccessories soar as heat dominates
OL,5,Cspending
OL,7,FEngland's World Cup performances
OL,8,Fcontributed to the volume of pub
OL,9,Ftransactions growing 10% in July, with
OL,10,Fthe value of spending up 7.4% ` its
OL,11,Fhighest level since December 2023.
OL,13,FMeanwhile, the overall hospitality and
OL,14,Fleisure category grew 2.2%, with
OL,15,Fcinemas enjoying a 2.6% boost
OL,16,Ffollowing the release of Toy Story 5
OL,17,Fand The Odyssey.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
