PN,30407
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1786411079
OL,3,CSales of cool clothes and garden
OL,4,Caccessories soar as heat dominates
OL,5,Cspending
OL,7,FTravel spending declined for the fifth
OL,8,Fconsecutive month, down 0.3%, with
OL,9,Fairline spending contracting by 6% but
OL,10,Fhotels, resorts and accommodation
OL,11,Fgrowing 2.6%, suggesting holidaymakers
OL,12,Fare still prioritising staycations
OL,13,Fover trips abroad.
OL,15,FA survey for the bank found 20% of UK
OL,16,Fadults bought light and cool summer
OL,17,Fclothes in response to the heatwave.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/8
