PN,30408
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1786411079
OL,3,CSales of cool clothes and garden
OL,4,Caccessories soar as heat dominates
OL,5,Cspending
OL,7,FRohan Kumar, head of spend insights at
OL,8,FBarclays, said: "Card spending
OL,9,Fstrengthened further in July, reaching
OL,10,Fits highest level for 12 months, with
OL,11,Fboth essential and non-essential spend
OL,12,Fremaining in growth.
OL,14,F"Multiple factors played a part, with
OL,15,FUK staycations, continued warm weather
OL,16,Fand England's World Cup run lifting
OL,17,Fspending on travel, hospitality,
OL,18,Feveryday essentials and seasonal
OL,19,Fretail categories."
